From 3626e89c417607bb81ed46794a9eb038eaaf40f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yusuke Hayashi <yusuke8h@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 02:17:56 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Write the objects of a document into a caller-supplied sink

Document::finish_into hands the indirect objects that Document::finish
writes to an ObjectSink, numbered with numbers the sink allocates, and
returns the objects that a catalog would reference. The numbering pass
is shared with the PDF writer, which allocates sequentially.
